{"branch":"신곡점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">신곡점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-52f81dd8d0e475e0.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"신곡점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-52f81dd8d0e475e0.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 의정부시 장곡로 626 금오종합상가 A동 302, 303호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">의정부경전철</span><span>경기도청북부청사역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">의정부경전철</span><span>효자역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">의정부경전철</span><span>새말역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">의정부경전철</span><span>곤제역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>경기도청북부청사</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>홈플러스</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>경기도청북부청사.신곡새마을금고.삼성래미안아파트앞</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>홈플러스</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>경기도청북부청사</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>경기도청북부청사</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>금오주공3단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>금오주공3단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">9</span><span>홈플러스</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">10</span><span>홈플러스</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">11</span><span>제일은행금오지점(마을)</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">12</span><span>경기도청북부청사</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">13</span><span>홈플러스</span></l